      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 66 Kanun dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menomborkan semula seksyen yang sedia ada sebagai subseksyen (1);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (1)(b)(i) yang dinomborkan semula itu—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “Senior Inspector of Mines” dengan perkataan “Director of Mines”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “mining” dengan perkataan “mineral development”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (1)(c)(ii) yang dinomborkan semula itu, dengan menggantikan noktah bertindih di hujung subperenggan dengan noktah;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong proviso kepada subseksyen (1) yang dinomborkan semula itu; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) yang dinomborkan semula itu subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) Nothing in this section shall authorize the Land Administrator to issue temporary occupation licences in respect of: (a) any such river and up to fifty metres of the bank of any such river; or (b) any such lake or spring and up to fifty metres from the edge of any such lake or spring, as may be declared by the State Authority by notification in the Gazette in accordance with the proviso to section 13.”. Pindaan seksyen 68a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 68a Kanun dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “as security for” perkataan “the due performance and observance of the provisions to which the licence is subject and”. Pindaan seksyen 71"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@/~cl_12",
