      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 324 Kanun dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen yang berikut: “(4) Notwithstanding the provision of subsection 431(1), it is sufficient for the notification to be served by ordinary post and shall be deemed to have been effected at the time at which the notification would be delivered in the ordinary course of post.”. Pindaan seksyen 325"
      }
