      "eli:number": "47",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 325(1) Kanun dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “by a notice in Form 19g” perkataan “, duly attested in accordance with the provision of section 211 notwithstanding that the provisions dealt with dealings in alienated land,”. Pindaan seksyen 326"
